{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_01_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_01","title":"6:44P.M.","storyCode":"CB-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eba9166c42ffa837db7e48f27600ecb800f2c7ffa6bc4ad686529544c99c7f87","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorway"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:44 P.M.    天氣/晴\n龍門繞城公路，車內"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺，您睡著了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，抱歉......我們到哪兒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就快到約定的碰頭地點了，請打起精神來，少爺。企鵝物流的諸位已經在等著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您看上去很疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"請原諒我多嘴，但老爺這次的決定實在是有些倉促，如果少爺有什麼難處，請務必開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親，一定有他自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，只要能在企鵝物流有所作為，父親身邊的那些人，說不定就不會再阻攔我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺是家族有史以來最年輕的信使，您的工作能力無可挑剔，這就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧，但是，那些大人們未必會這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"看看窗外，現在龍門大半的民營信使業務已經落到了父親的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流，他們是最後的，也是最獨立的，奇怪傳聞最多的公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然父親和大帝先生的關係好像很好，可我們必須瞭解他們，至少我得這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才會擔心少爺，企鵝物流太過於特殊了，我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用總擺出這麼一副表情。我可以自己處理好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"您也是，少爺。多像同齡人一樣笑一笑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚是安魂夜，您本可以和朋友們一起去街上逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是在嘲笑我沒朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"豈敢，豈敢，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，少爺，您的盾還在手邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被盯上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發現目標，準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，引爆組的導火線似乎有點短......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不是問題，動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——爆炸！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"少爺，抓穩了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"發現目標，還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把他帶走，動作快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（居然炸毀了公路.....？到底，是誰......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死，視野......看不清......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"目擊者很多，但沒有看見其他目標人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，煙霧裡還有其他人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有倖存者？那就一起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂？喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼簡單就被幹掉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，我可不喜歡這麼老套的電影戲碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喲，看來你很清楚嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在我看來，在邊郊公路中央設置路障再埋下炸彈，這手法也是相當復古哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爆破只是個人愛好，環顧一下你的周圍，事情沒這麼簡單。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，那個蠢貨竟然用了這麼多源石炸藥，如果讓鼠王知道了，我們吃不了兜著走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"發現企鵝物流的信使，是能天使。她把爆破組的人都給......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我不瞎，無所謂。那隻叫德克薩斯的狼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒有看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。那就算了，包圍他們，速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"果然還有埋伏，做得挺徹底嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你還能動嗎？手腳都搖搖晃晃的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......勉強吧，你就是......能天使小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！你是叫，呃，什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們得先離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不要繃著一張臉，那位老管家平安無事哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且有把他送到路邊，不過看他的樣子其實不太需要幫忙......但是算啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流的能天使，還有這位小少爺，投降吧，跟我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不少生面孔呢，都是你在敘拉古的親戚？有沒有提醒他們在龍門搶生意的注意事項？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"這不關你事，這一次，我們會把你們徹底擊潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......在龍門待了這麼多年，你們搶地盤的方式倒是最簡單粗暴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"看來敘拉古的黑手黨也不是只有在酒吧挨揍的份嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......你會後悔小看西西里人的，*龍門粗口*，動手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我這算勉強趕上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"時機完美，可頌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們好像不打算收手耶，接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"老規矩，你開路，我殿後，完事獎金對半分~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——不客氣了啊啊啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那個怪力瘋子直接撞開了一條路！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們先追，不要跟太緊，等首領的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你把他們放跑了，廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，綁票本來就不是我的長項。企鵝物流其他成員沒有出現，部署完成之前，貿然進入龍門市區對我們不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你找藉口，有一輛車向你那兒去了。開著敞篷，可都是熟到發焦的老熟人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼快？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好，這是第幾個死胡同了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"反正周圍都是些幾百年沒人管的爛尾樓，不如直接在牆上開個洞吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，兩位！我們到底要去哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們在這兒！居然鑽到死胡同裡等死，包圍他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這不是無路可退了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼對策！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還沒正式打過招呼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們全部幹掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不是說這個的時候吧！這很重要嗎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這很重要，非常重要，相當重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們可是非常注重塑造企業文化的，而今天的文化關鍵字恰好是“儀式感”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是剛剛決定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是大帝！快通知首領！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，後面還有一個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"餌撒空了，能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古的傢伙們也不全是傻瓜嘛，下次還有機會，別介意別介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，給你們介紹一下，這位就是我們企鵝物流的臨時成員，拜松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙堵住了退路，只、只能動手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"都躺下，輪不到你們送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！不要慌，只要拖到首領的支援——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"拖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"開燈，啊哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_2_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好閃！哪兒來的聚光燈！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到企鵝物流，小貓小狗們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經出現在我的視線之內，而我視線之內就是企鵝帝國的國土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，請問你們的過境簽證有帶在身上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們得準備好哭著回家找媽媽了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
